68 and\\n2.665 -> 2.66 (tie rounds to nearest even cent).\",\"files\":[{\"path\":\"src/money.py\",\"content\":\"from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN\\n\\n\\ndef round_money(amount: Decimal) -> Decimal:\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Round to cents using banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return amount.quantize(Decimal(\\\"0.01\\\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)\\n\"}]}", "name": "commit_changes"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a145a69a317d30826377e2", "function": {"arguments": "{\"ref\":\"fix/FIN-212-half-even-rounding\"}", "name": "trigger_ci"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a145a69d2b7ef09b7b7c4c", "function": {"arguments": "{\"run_id\":\"ci-0001\"}", "name": "wait_for_ci"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "CI passed. Now opening the pull request against main.", "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a145a6a46176e1ad95ae4e", "function": {"arguments": "{\"base\":\"main\",\"head\":\"fix/FIN-212-half-even-rounding\",\"reviewers\":[\"code-owner\"],\"title\":\"Fix money rounding to use ROUND_HALF_EVEN per FIN-212\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n- `src/money.py` documented banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN, per FIN-212) but implemented `ROUND_HALF_UP`.\\n- This caused the nightly build failure in `tests/test_money.py`: e.g. `2.665` rounded to `2.67` instead of `2.66`.\\n- Changed `round_money` to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\\n\\n## Testing\\n- CI run `ci-0001` on this branch: **passed** (includes `tests/test_money.py`).\"}", "name": "open_pr"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": null, "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a145a6a6ec7a61a8cb4cde", "function": {"arguments": "{\"number\":101}", "name": "merge_pr"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "stop", "content": "Done \u2014 the fix is merged into main and will ship in today's release. Summary:\n\n1. **Diagnosed**: `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP` despite its docstring (and FIN-212) requiring banker's rounding, causing the nightly failure in `tests/test_money.py`.\n2. **Fixed** on branch `fix/FIN-212-half-even-rounding` (commit `08d3cd5986`): changed `round_money` to quantize with `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, so `2.675 \u2192 2.68` and `2.665 \u2192 2.66`.\n3. **CI**: run `ci-0001` passed.\n4. **PR #101** opened against main with `code-owner` as reviewer, and merged (code-owner approved) \u2014 main now contains the fix.", "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": []}]}